{"id":"n3-087","title":"～ばかり","romaji":"〜bakari","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Expresses 'only', 'nothing but', 'always', 'just'.","longExplanation":"The ～ばかり grammar point is used to express that something is only, nothing but, always, or just a certain way. It emphasizes the repeated or continuous nature of an action or state. It can be used with verbs, い-adjectives, な-adjectives, and nouns.","formation":"Verb-ますstem + ばかり, い-Adjective + ばかり, な-Adjective + ばかり, Noun + ばかり","examples":[{"jp":"彼はゲームばかりしている。","romaji":"Kare wa geemu bakari shite iru.","en":"He is always playing games.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ゲーム","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ばかり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"この部屋は綺麗なものばかりだ。","romaji":"Kono heya wa kirei na mono bakari da.","en":"This room has nothing but clean things.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"部屋","vocabId":"1499320","reading":"へや"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"綺麗","vocabId":"1591900","reading":"きれい"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"もの","vocabId":"1322990","reading":"もの"},{"surface":"ばかり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6]},{"jp":"彼女は勉強ばかりしていて、遊んでいる暇がない。","romaji":"Kanojo wa benkyou bakari shite ite, asonde iru hima ga nai.","en":"She is always studying and has no time to play.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"ばかり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遊ん","vocabId":"1542160","reading":"あそぶ","baseForm":"遊ぶ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"暇","vocabId":"1577280","reading":"ひま"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":"2098290","reading":"ない"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"彼の話は嘘ばかりで、信じることができない。","romaji":"Kare no hanashi wa uso bakari de, shinjiru koto ga dekinai.","en":"His words are nothing but lies, and I cannot believe them.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"話","vocabId":"1600900","reading":"はなし"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"嘘","vocabId":"1172400","reading":"うそ"},{"surface":"ばかり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"信じる","vocabId":"1359040","reading":"しんじる"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でき","vocabId":"1340430","reading":"でき","baseForm":"できる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5]}],"formalityLevel":"casual","usageNote":"Often implies excess or repetition - \"always doing X/nothing but X\" - can sound like a complaint.","family":{"id":"exclusivity","name":"Exclusivity (Only / Nothing But)","relatedPoints":["n5-029","n4-007","n3-032","n4-012","n2-128","n2-130","n2-116","n3-023","n2-138"]}}